    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I run a small online stationery shop based in France. We're preparing for a quarterly audit and I need to make sure we're fully GDPR compliant. Could you give me a summary of the core principles we need to follow, specifically regarding how we handle customer email addresses and shipping addresses?",
